/**
 * The `mask-repeat` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property sets how mask
 * images are repeated. A mask image can be repeated along the horizontal axis, the vertical axis,
 * both axes, or not repeated at all.
 *
 * Initial: repeat. Inherited: no.
 * Percentages: not accepted.
 *
 * Grammar: <repeat-style>#
