 * The equivalent of `no-repeat repeat`. The image is repeated in the vertical direction as many
 * times as needed to cover the height of the mask painting area. Mask images along the top or
 * bottom edges, or both depending on the `mask-position` value, will be clipped if the height of
 * the mask origin box is not an exact multiple of the mask image's height.
 */
